# CMR and Container bootstrap, at /var/runtime/bootstrap. A POSIX sh wrapper that execs the image's
# pwsh against the runtime loop; pwsh -File runs runtime.ps1 in the global scope. It is a wrapper,
# not a pwsh shebang, because Linux passes everything after a shebang's interpreter as ONE argument,
# so a shebang cannot carry both -NoProfile and -NonInteractive. -NonInteractive: nothing can answer
# a prompt in Lambda, so a handler that prompts gets PowerShell's NonInteractive error, not the
# prompt text in the log and a NullReferenceException.
exec /var/runtime/powershell/pwsh -NoProfile -NonInteractive -File /var/runtime/runtime.ps1
